WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:02.280 --> 00:00:05.240
This is Jonathan Van Ness, formerly of Quincy
Senior High School,

00:00:05.240 --> 00:00:08.180
wishing you a gorgeous day.

00:00:10.500 --> 00:00:13.940
Are you guys ready to learn about who we’re
helping tonight?

00:00:13.940 --> 00:00:15.080
Yeah!

00:00:15.080 --> 00:00:16.560
Kathi was my orchestra teacher.

00:00:16.560 --> 00:00:19.930
She’s so dedicated that she puts herself
on the back burner.

00:00:19.930 --> 00:00:23.660
I’ve never had a conversation with a gay
person before.

00:00:23.660 --> 00:00:25.830
We’ll see how it goes.

00:00:25.830 --> 00:00:28.560
What he’s doing for his community is incredible.

00:00:28.560 --> 00:00:32.410
She’s been wearing the same makeup and hairstyle
since the 90s.

00:00:32.410 --> 00:00:33.860
Jeez, honey.

00:00:33.860 --> 00:00:39.309
I’m ready to let go of my old life and grow
into my new.

00:00:39.309 --> 00:00:41.829
Try not to cry, try not to lose it.

00:00:41.829 --> 00:00:43.500
Welcome home!

00:00:45.240 --> 00:00:47.340
You look like a brand new man!

00:00:50.700 --> 00:00:54.200
People should always remember it’s never
too late to start over.

00:00:54.210 --> 00:00:57.710
You’re stable, you’re loving, you took
care of your parents.

00:00:57.710 --> 00:00:59.780
Don’t compare yourself to them.

00:00:59.780 --> 00:01:00.980
You are not a failure.

00:01:01.280 --> 00:01:03.560
You’ve literally saved people’s lives.

00:01:03.600 --> 00:01:04.900
Mine included.

00:01:09.840 --> 00:01:13.220
All any of us have done is highlight the best
parts of you.

00:01:13.229 --> 00:01:14.619
You’re a warrior.

00:01:14.619 --> 00:01:18.149
You have people who look up to you and they’re
people that you can look up to.

00:01:18.149 --> 00:01:21.940
Being able to let you guys in has transformed
me and I love you guys, man.

